# Refresh the local Telegram cache every 15 minutes.
# Credentials are read from the protected data-dir .env automatically —
# never put TG_API_ID/TG_API_HASH into the crontab.
# The log lives inside the private data dir, not in world-readable /tmp.
*/15 * * * * "$HOME/.local/bin/tg" refresh --yaml >> "$HOME/Library/Application Support/tg-cli/refresh.log" 2>&1
# Linux data dir: "$HOME/.local/share/tg-cli/refresh.log"
